0,Guaicuruan languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guaicuruan_languages,"Guaicuruan (Guaykuruan, Waikurúan, Guaycuruano, Guaikurú, Guaicuru, Guaycuruana) is a language family spoken in northern Argentina, western Paraguay, and Brazil (Mato Grosso do Sul). The speakers of the languages are often collectively called the Guaycuru peoples.",Abipon,Guaykuruan
